رِينَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/2544c03bd3bd983d0a2f.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "12:20", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1616.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And they sold him for a low price, a number of silver coins; and they attached no value to him.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ve onu düşük bir değerle birkaç dirheme sattılar. Ona fazla önem vermemişlerdi.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور بھائیوں نے اسے کھوٹے داموں گنتی کے روپوں پر بیچ ڈالا اور انہیں اس میں کچھ رغبت نہ تھی", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan mereka menjual Yusuf dengan harga yang murah, yaitu beberapa dirham saja, dan mereka merasa tidak tertarik hatinya kepada Yusuf.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَشَرَوْهُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/eee20e6cdd7e424671df.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i prodali su ga", "en": "and they sold him", "tr": "ve onu sattılar", "fr": "et ils l'ont vendu", "id": "dan mereka menjualnya", "ur": "اور انہوں نے اسے بیچ دیا", "bn": "তারা তাকে বিক্রি করে দিয়েছিল", "fa": "و او را فروختند"}}, {"text": "بِثَمَنٍۭ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بَخْسٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "دَرَٰهِمَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَعْدُودَةٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَكَانُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِيهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلزَّٰهِدِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "2:207", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/214.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And of mankind is he who would sell himself, seeking the pleasure of Allah; and Allah hath compassion on (His) bondmen.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Yine insanlardan kimi de vardır ki, Allah'ın rızasına ermek için kendini feda eder. Allah ise kullarına çok merhametlidir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور کوئی آدمی اپنی جان بیچتا ہے اللہ کی مرضی چاہنے میں اور اللہ بندوں پر مہربان ہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan di antara manusia ada orang yang mengorbankan dirinya karena mencari keridhaan Allah; dan Allah Maha Penyantun kepada hamba-hamba-Nya.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَمِنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَشْرِى", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/8644ce6e40ae2a765eb3.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "prodaje", "en": "sells", "tr": "satar", "fr": "vend", "id": "menjual", "ur": "بیچتا ہے", "bn": "সে বিক্রি করে দেয়", "fa": "می‌فروشد"}}, {"text": "نَفْسَهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱبْتِغَآءَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَرْضَاتِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَءُوفٌۢ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِٱلْعِبَادِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "شَرَوْا۟", "count": 1, "first": "2:102", "audio": "audio/59acf14d845940157cfc.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "they sold", "bs": "prodali su", "tr": "sattılar", "fr": "ils ont vendu",